{"4362490":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"99 NIGHTS IN THE APOCALYPSE","steam_appid":4362490,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5148750,5216880],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to gather resources, build your camp, explore, and survive 99 nights together. Work as a team, because things get a lot harder after dark.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night brings new dangers. Defend your camp from increasingly dangerous enemies, keep your fire burning, and make it through another night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR CAMP<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft tools, and build your camp from the ground up. Unlock new structures, upgrade your defenses, and prepare for what's coming.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/832c9750ad23ae54541111e6f627f187.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/832c9750ad23ae54541111e6f627f187.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/832c9750ad23ae54541111e6f627f187.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond your camp to discover new biomes, hidden locations, valuable resources, and dangerous enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT EPIC BOSSES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on powerful bosses with unique attacks and challenges. Gear up, work together, and fight your way through increasingly difficult encounters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/fd661e92967128262e363154ba8cc4a6.webp?t=1792439571\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/fd661e92967128262e363154ba8cc4a6.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=346 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the crazier things get. Unlock strange contraptions, discover ridiculous surprises, and turn your camp into something truly unique.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends to gather resources, build your camp, explore, and survive 99 nights together. Work as a team, because things get a lot harder after dark.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akama