tatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/832c9750ad23ae54541111e6f627f187.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture beyond your camp to discover new biomes, hidden locations, valuable resources, and dangerous enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/8ce30d915485c7ce34a16d6cc5372a35.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT EPIC BOSSES<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on powerful bosses with unique attacks and challenges. Gear up, work together, and fight your way through increasingly difficult encounters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/fd661e92967128262e363154ba8cc4a6.webp?t=1792439571\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/fd661e92967128262e363154ba8cc4a6.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=346 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPECT THE UNEXPECTED<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the crazier things get. Unlock strange contraptions, discover ridiculous surprises, and turn your camp into something truly unique.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.poster.avif?t=1792439571\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.webm?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4362490\/extras\/363e75961f47bbf4622c77423dc715b9.mp4?t=1792439571\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A 1-5 player co-op survival game. Team up with friends to survive 99 nights in a post-apocalyptic world. Gather resources, build your camp, craft weapons, explore different biomes, and fight off waves of enemies and powerful bosses.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French<strong>*<\/strong>, Italian<strong>*<\/strong>, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<strong>*<\/strong>, Norwegian<strong>*<\/strong>, Polish<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*<\/strong>, Swedish<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Turkish<strong>*<\/strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian<strong>*<\/strong>, Arabic<strong>*<\/strong>, Bulgarian<strong>*<\/strong>, Czech<strong>*<\/strong>, Danish<strong>*<\/strong>, Dutch<strong>*<\/strong>, Finnish<strong>*<\/strong>, Greek<strong>*<\/strong>, Hungarian<strong>*<\/strong>, Indonesian<strong>*<\/strong>, Malay<strong>*<\/strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*<\/strong>, Romanian<strong>*<\/strong>, Thai<strong>*<\/strong>, Vietnamese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps